    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>&quot;A container that may or may not hold a value. The value, if present, may be a &quot; &quot;Tensor, Sparse Tensor, Sequence, Map, or another Optional. An absent value is &quot; &quot;semantically different from a present value that contains an empty tensor, &quot; &quot;sequence, or map. For example, an absent optional tensor means the absence of &quot; &quot;the tensor itself, whereas a present optional tensor that contains an empty &quot; &quot;tensor means the tensor is present but it has no elements.&quot; <linebreak/>
 </para>
    </detaileddescription>
